WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:06,740
Is Fangyang a prodigal or a Tibetan?

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:09,640
Master, we found the shop

3
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:12,640
Just on the street that intersects Changlefang in the east of Dongshi

4
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,640
How is the location?

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:18,220
The crowds are extremely popular, but the rent is not low.

6
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:22,590
Master, we spend our money too quickly

7
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:25,590
It’s not that the money is wasted, it’s that I earned the money and went out to explore the road first.

8
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,590
The young master's words don't sound like a good person.

9
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:31,590
Isn't this the famous prodigal son of Fang in the capital?

10
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,590
Why aren't you with Miss Song today?

11
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:35,590
Lian'er, look at the soles of your shoes

12
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:36,660
What's wrong with the young master?

13
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,660
Weird, I didn’t step on shit

14
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,660
Why is there a dog on my feet?

15
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,660
Who are you calling a dog?

16
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,660
Why do you want to fight?

17
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,660
Thick nose, do you see it?

18
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,660
That's my Xie family's restaurant

19
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,660
How dare you sell alcohol here?

20
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,690
I made you lose all your money.

21
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:51,690
What a coincidence. They are all restaurants.

22
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,690
Xie Ping, I advise you to change your career as soon as possible

23
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:54,690
It's up to you

24
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:56,690
Waiting for My Heavenly Sin to open tomorrow

25
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:58,690
You will definitely be the first to go bankrupt

26
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:01,690
I'm waiting to see if you have any compensation for Xie Ku.
